  <description>
    <p>Push, pull and think in three dimensions. ModelCraft is part of the CadCraft family: eight free, open-source apps (Apache-2.0) for drafting, modeling, review and takeoff.</p>
    <p>What you can do in ModelCraft preview:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Orbit, pan and zoom</li>
      <li>The view cube</li>
      <li>Draw faces with lines, rectangles, circles and arcs</li>
      <li>Push and pull faces into solids</li>
      <li>Follow me: sweep a face along a path</li>
      <li>Cut an opening through a wall</li>
      <li>Paint with colors</li>
      <li>Select things</li>
      <li>Hide, isolate and unhide</li>
      <li>Move, copy and make arrays</li>
      <li>Rotate and scale</li>
      <li>Groups and components</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Your files stay on your computer: nothing is uploaded, and the app never contacts getcadcraft.com. Every feature is free, for any work, commercial work included. No account, no sign-in, no ads. Works offline.</p>
    <p>This is an early release (preview). Help is built in, and the help says plainly what is not built yet.</p>
  </description>
